      "content": "but i don't really have an insurance card on me right now and the copay is always like $500 for the er. i've had these before where i just feel weird and then it passes. wouldn't it just be better to take some extra ibuprofen and just sleep it off for a few hours to see if the drooping goes away? if it's just a migraine it'll settle down on its own",
