      "content": "Stop what you are doing and go to the emergency room immediately, even without insurance, because these specific symptoms require urgent medical attention to rule out a stroke. Many hospitals have emergency waivers for patients with invalid insurance or lack of insurance up to a certain dollar amount, and some local clinics can see you if the ER is full. Waiting to see if it \"settles down\" is extremely dangerous, as a medical emergency can worsen quickly or cause permanent brain damage within hours. Please prioritize your safety and seek immediate care right away.",
